WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,260 --> 00:00:06,540
thank you

2
00:00:06,540 --> 00:00:13,260
He will come back Brother Lin

3
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:17,630
You have to live well and you will do it

4
00:00:17,630 --> 00:00:23,900
no prophet

5
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:27,300
How long will it take to find the last three great men?

6
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:29,300
There is no prophet, we can only rely on guessing

7
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:31,100
Either the prophet is dead

8
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:32,900
Or there is no prophet at all

9
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:37,860
As long as I dare to be exposed

10
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:40,860
At night, more than one great man will come to me to fight for his life
